    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "8b3dc768dc8605d0fa34": "The body is that of a female orc warrior.$B$BIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.",
        "f7e9f4aaafb9f2696def": "You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.$B$BBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.$B$BHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.",
        "zephras:32d94721b2b33039e734": "I inspect the body further."
      },
      "name": "Beaten Corpse",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.8b3dc768dc8605d0fa34": {
            "origin": "community",
